<urn:usf:provider-operation:host-source-identity:1> <urn:usf:predicate:authenticationModeRule> "Derive authenticationModeDigest only from the graph-mapped exact first-party mode and the matching sanitized authenticated-mode projection in the content-authenticated census; exclude account identity, subscription label, model surface, timestamp, expiry and the encompassing authentication/authorization digest." <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
<urn:usf:provider-operation:host-source-identity:1> <urn:usf:predicate:stableDigestRule> "credentialSourceIdentityDigest is the schema-defined digest over exact source/mapping identity plus credentialFileIdentityDigest, executableIdentityDigest and authenticationModeDigest only. Reconstruct accountSourceKeyDigest from the complete selected mapping plus that stable identity. The record contains observedAt but no host-authorization digest or expiry, so routine authorization refresh changes neither the reusable record nor source key; credential/executable/mode movement changes both." <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
